<name>Transmission/Transaxle</name>
<section id="1002B_S001H" variety="S001H">
<name>Automatic Transaxle</name>
<ttl id="1002B_S001H_74Y0X_T00H8" variety="T00H8">
<name>Electronically Controlled Automatic Transaxle [ECT] (U660E)</name>
<para id="RM000001I3N00GX" category="C" type-id="305RH" name-id="261H5-00" from="200708">
<dtccode>P0724/95</dtccode>
<dtcname>STP Light SW ON Malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000001I3N00GX_05" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FTW00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<list1 type="nonmark">
<item>
<ptxt>The transmission control computer uses the ON signal input from the stop light switch for downshift control on downhill slopes and lock-up ON/OFF control.</ptxt>
<ptxt>A DTC is output if the stop light switch assembly remains ON even after repeated stop &amp; go.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="0.86in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.20in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.02in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
<ptxt>SAE/TCCS</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
<ptxt>1. Detection condition 2. Malfunction status 3. Malfunction duration 4. Other</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>P0724/95</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>IG ON, battery voltage 8V or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Stop light switch remains ON</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>While stopping the vehicle (vehicle speed 3km/h or less) and driving (vehicle speed 30km/h or more) are repeated 5 times</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>2 trip</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Wire Harness or Connector</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Stop Light Switch Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Transmission Control Computer Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</item>
</list1>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000001I3N00GX_06" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FTX00000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C096033J04" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000001I3N00GX_07" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000001I3N00GX_04" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000001I3N00GX_04_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FTT00000">
<scantool type="4"/>
<testtitle>Read TaSCAN Data (Stop Light Switch)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), follow the screen display to display the [ECU Data Monitor] screen and check the computer data.</ptxt>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1" pgwide="1">
<title>[Selection Menu Screen: Powertrain → ECT → ECU Data Monitor]</title>
<tgroup cols="4" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="C01" colwidth="1.01in"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="C02" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colnum="3" colname="C03" colwidth="2.45in"/>
<colspec colnum="4" colname="C04" colwidth="1.55in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item Name</ptxt>
<ptxt>[Symbol]</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item Description/Display Range</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard Value</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C04" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Remarks</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Stop</ptxt>
<ptxt>Light SW</ptxt>
<ptxt>[STP]</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>Indicates brake pedal is depressed</ptxt>
<ptxt>Display: ON/OFF</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="left">
<ptxt>OFF→ON</ptxt>
<ptxt>Brake pedal released → depressed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C04" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Stop light switch signal</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001I3N00GX_04_0008" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000001I3N00GX_04_0007" fin="false">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001I3N00GX_04_0007" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FTV00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Stop Light Switch Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Remove the stop light switch assembly.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using the SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between each terminal.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="I013683J02" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="0.88in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.13in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle">
<ptxt>1 - 2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Shaft not pushed in</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Shaft pushed in</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>10k Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle">
<ptxt>3 - 4</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Shaft not pushed in</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>10k Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Shaft pushed in</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001I3N00GX_04_0002" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000001I3N00GX_04_0006" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001I3N00GX_04_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___0000FTU00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness and Connector (Stop Light Switch - Transmission Control Computer)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the wire harness and connector inspection procedure and precautions, see <xref href="RM0000005D702RX" label="Seep01"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<test1>
<ptxt>Install the stop light switch assembly and connect the connector.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the transmission control computer connector. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM0000024M9003X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check that the connector case and terminals are not damaged, deformed or corroded.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the voltage between terminal 12 (STP) and body ground.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C169062J04" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.77in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="0.98in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle">
<ptxt>12 (STP) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>OFF</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Brake pedal released)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>0 to 1.5V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>ON</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Brake pedal depressed)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>7.5 to 14V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001I3N00GX_04_0003" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000001I3N00GX_04_0004" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
